==Rolling Stock==
The Tokuyama Line utilizes overhead catenary electrification (1,500 V DC) to ensure compatibility with Tokutetsu private railway standards.

* [[Okami Metro 1000 series|1000 series]] (6-car sets):
*: The latest fleet introduced in 2018 to replace the original 10 series. These trains feature a stainless steel body with a rose-pink band. They are designed with high acceleration capabilities to manage the frequent stops within the city center before running express on the suburban Tokutetsu line.
* [[Tokutetsu]] 5000 series (6-car sets):
*: Private railway stock owned by Tokutetsu. Known as the "Southern Cross," these trains feature a distinctive navy blue livery and transverse seating, offering a comfortable ride for long-distance commuters coming from Tokuyama Prefecture.

